cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this workflow in research or teaching, please cite it as below."
title: "lit-review-6step: a six-stage literature review pipeline as agent skills"
abstract: >-
  A six-stage literature review workflow (question, search strategy, search and
  screening, close reading and extraction, synthesis and drafting, final editing)
  packaged as Agent Skills, with entry points at any stage, stage gates, and a
  seven-section survey outline for the "new technology on an old problem" pattern.
